            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mary Goodenough"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is an excellent recipe. We buy shrimp at our local deli and have it steamed with cajun seasoning. We chop shrimp and add to other ingredients. We love it and have shared this recipe with family and friends. Mary Goodenough Fayetteville, TN",
            "datePublished": "2010-04-21T12:57:14.683Z"
